{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab the object. Check its properties, move to designated location or scan the area. Do specific task if failed. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDesignatedLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = Idle    />",
